    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chloe the Cat is collectathon precision platformer where you play as Chloe, a black tortoiseshell cat. On her adventure, Chloe encounters gargantuan grapes, dodges dangerous spikes, and chases after mischievous mice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins and food, buy hats to show off to all your friends, and persevere through the toughest of platforming challenges. Finally, face off against the evil mouse that stole Chloe's dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/82fab82e687f253b3533841240616b35.poster.avif?t=1753541441\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/82fab82e687f253b3533841240616b35.webm?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/82fab82e687f253b3533841240616b35.mp4?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 levels and a hub world set in colorful sprawling environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 100+ food cans scattered around every kitty-corner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look by donning a variety of hats and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purrfect your skills by racing against the clock with timed runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with accessibility options to go at your own pace</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Chloe, you can jump off the ground and leap from walls, claw away enemies in a spinning frenzy, and pounce to quickly boost forward. Combine these 3 simple moves with tight controls to navigate treacherous obstacles and explore to your heart's content.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/5e01984003ae1ac1be42747014918eaa.poster.avif?t=1753541441\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/5e01984003ae1ac1be42747014918eaa.webm?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/5e01984003ae1ac1be42747014918eaa.mp4?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect 'Em All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather coins to purchase a wide selection of hats to express yourself. Stake out at flags to use as checkpoints scattered throughout the land. Find food cans in hard-to-reach places and where you'd least expect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Makes Purrfect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With frequent checkpoints and much more than 9 lives, no challenge is impawssible. You'll quickly learn from your mistakes and find yourself breezing past challenges you were hopelessly stuck at before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/c142223d6324c0c9d2818bee05925ca4.poster.avif?t=1753541441\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/c142223d6324c0c9d2818bee05925ca4.webm?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/c142223d6324c0c9d2818bee05925ca4.mp4?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shoot for a New Record</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For speedrunning experts, sprint to the finish line and shoot for a new personal best practicing your fastest techniques. Or slow down and tread carefully, navigating through  each level unscathed for Chloe's sake. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun for All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a bit of trouble, or just want to save Chloe from despair? Ease the pain with accessibility options so anyone can enjoy, whether you're brand new to gaming or a platforming veteran.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chloe the Cat is collectathon precision platformer where you play as Chloe, a black tortoiseshell cat. On her adventure, Chloe encounters gargantuan grapes, dodges dangerous spikes, and chases after mischievous mice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins and food, buy hats to show off to all your friends, and persevere through the toughest of platforming challenges. Finally, face off against the evil mouse that stole Chloe's dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/82fab82e687f253b3533841240616b35.poster.avif?t=1753541441\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/82fab82e687f253b3533841240616b35.webm?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/82fab82e687f253b3533841240616b35.mp4?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 levels and a hub world set in colorful sprawling environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 100+ food cans scattered around every kitty-corner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look by donning a variety of hats and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purrfect your skills by racing against the clock with timed runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with accessibility options to go at your own pace</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Chloe, you can jump off the ground and leap from walls, claw away enemies in a spinning frenzy, and pounce to quickly boost forward. Combine these 3 simple moves with tight controls to navigate treacherous obstacles and explore to your heart's content.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/5e01984003ae1ac1be42747014918eaa.poster.avif?t=1753541441\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/5e01984003ae1ac1be42747014918eaa.webm?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/5e01984003ae1ac1be42747014918eaa.mp4?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect 'Em All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather coins to purchase a wide selection of hats to express yourself. Stake out at flags to use as checkpoints scattered throughout the land. Find food cans in hard-to-reach places and where you'd least expect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Makes Purrfect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With frequent checkpoints and much more than 9 lives, no challenge is impawssible. You'll quickly learn from your mistakes and find yourself breezing past challenges you were hopelessly stuck at before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/c142223d6324c0c9d2818bee05925ca4.poster.avif?t=1753541441\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/c142223d6324c0c9d2818bee05925ca4.webm?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801920/extras/c142223d6324c0c9d2818bee05925ca4.mp4?t=1753541441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shoot for a New Record</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For speedrunning experts, sprint to the finish line and shoot for a new personal best practicing your fastest techniques. Or slow down and tread carefully, navigating through  each level unscathed for Chloe's sake. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun for All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a bit of trouble, or just want to save Chloe from despair? Ease the pain with accessibility options so anyone can enjoy, whether you're brand new to gaming or a platforming veteran.</p>",
